{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0114_1000_020meg", "source_sha256": "73759cc2d2c8718869714514002b060bd5f8d9886aff5d05ac4610e36ae3e207", "ja": "ん～。えっと、こんなカンジで……\nいや、こっちのがいいかな……？", "zh": "嗯～我看看，这种感觉……\n不对，这样比较好吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0114_1001_p", "source_sha256": "54cb71448ea33c4dbbcc4fc48f6c4a1b5be862b5de18bb0910bbb91b05183b44", "ja": "恵美……あ、ポーズの練習中だったか。\nずいぶん熱心だな！", "zh": "惠美……啊，你正在练习摆姿势呀。\n真是积极呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
